  "id": "auditory-skills",
  "term": "auditory skills",
  "definition": "Auditory skills are abilities used to hear and process sound details in speech or music. In this source, they include accurately encoding phonological details, perceiving pitch, and using auditory working memory to hold sound information long enough to learn word–object pairings.",
